sequenceDiagram
    participant Ui as LlmChatActivity
    participant Vm as LlmChatViewModel
    participant Sess as ChatSession
    participant Eng as LlmEngine
    participant Src as Mock或HTTP

    Ui->>Vm: SendMessage
    Vm->>Sess: applyConfig 后 send
    Sess->>Sess: 写入 system 与 user
    Sess->>Eng: chat ChatRequest
    Eng->>Sess: RequestReady JSON
    Sess->>Vm: onRequest
    Vm->>Ui: 展示请求体
    Eng->>Src: 开始生成
    loop stream 或逐 token
        Src->>Eng: delta.content
        Eng->>Sess: SseLine 与 Token
        Sess->>Sess: assistantBuffer 拼接
        Sess->>Vm: onTranscript partial
        Vm->>Ui: 当前 assistant 跳动
    end
    Src->>Eng: 结束或 DONE
    Eng->>Sess: Done
    Sess->>Sess: history 追加 assistant
    Sess->>Vm: onTranscript final
    Vm->>Ui: messages 历史定稿
